call Includes/Normal
# Fake maze perception from the ground truth pose until the real detectors exist (MZ-018, MZ-019).
# The maze comes from Config/Scenes/Includes/Maze/current.maze, written by maze_to_scene.py next to the scene.
for Cognition mr AprilTagPercept OracledMazePerceptsProvider
for Cognition mr WallPercept OracledMazePerceptsProvider
# Hide the game clock and score board: no game time or goals in the maze.
dr debugDrawing3d:representation:GameState off
call Includes/Views
# No automatic referee: it would penalize the robot for standing in the opponent half.
ar off
gc playing
dr unmute on
